Executable Application & Domain Service Layer
Version 1.0
Status: Implementation Specification
Predecessor: Database Schema & OpenAPI Contract v0.1
Architecture: Executable Application Stack & Implementation Architecture v0.2
Database: PostgreSQL
API: REST / JSON
