11. UNIT OF WORK
unit_of_work.py becomes the transactional boundary for domain mutations.
Conceptually:
with unit_of_work() as uow:
    project = uow.projects.get(project_id)

    command.execute(project)

    uow.commit()
The Unit of Work coordinates:
repositories
transactions
events
outbox records

