Project_ID
Revision_ID
Model_Version_ID
Code_Manifest_ID
the application must be able to retrieve the authoritative state required to reconstruct the project.

92. CURRENT STATE PROJECTION
The current project state is a projection of the latest committed model version.
The database may maintain:
current_revision_id
current_model_version_id
for fast access.
Historical versions remain immutable.

93. REVISION FINALIZATION
A revision progresses through controlled states.
Initial state model:
DRAFT
 ↓
VALIDATING
 ↓
VALIDATED
 ↓
DOCUMENTED
 ↓
ACCEPTED
Failure states may include:
REJECTED
INVALID
FAILED
State transitions must be explicit.

94. ACCEPTANCE FINALITY
Once a customer accepts a document package, the acceptance record identifies the exact package.
The system must not silently replace the accepted package with a later revision.
A subsequent design modification creates a new revision.

